And then in the Ectomobile stage, they just look like the kind that, like, you put the sheet over the head.

00:26:42.060 --> 00:26:45.260
Yeah. And that's fine, too, because that's, like, stereotypical ghost.

00:26:45.640 --> 00:26:47.460
But this is, you know, these are...

00:26:47.460 --> 00:26:48.340
These are will-o-wisps.

00:26:49.100 --> 00:26:50.840
Seagulls, they're dolphins, they're...

00:26:50.840 --> 00:26:53.660
I think they look like fish, yeah, they look like something like that.

