Right. Fish with sheets over their head.

00:26:55.500 --> 00:26:57.360
With a PH? Yes.

00:26:57.720 --> 00:26:59.960
And it just keeps happening, too.

00:27:00.160 --> 00:27:07.800
Like, they keep spawning, you keep shooting your fireballs at them, and it just...

00:27:07.800 --> 00:27:13.280
I like explaining, like, enemies populating the screen, like, and attacking you.

00:27:13.480 --> 00:27:15.280
It's like, this keeps happening.

00:27:15.820 --> 00:27:18.440
It keeps happening for a long time.

00:27:18.900 --> 00:27:22.300
Yeah. For a little bit of context, like, I don't remember.

00:27:22.420 --> 00:27:23.920
It felt really, really long to me.

00:27:23.920 --> 00:27:27.920
But right now, as usual, I'm watching a playthrough while we discuss.

